      "text": [
        "Fixture Bank Limited — Engagement Steering Pack",
        "Powered by DGIW",
        "What this pack claims, and what it does not",
        "EVERYTHING HERE WAS RECORDED, NOTHING WAS COMPUTED. Statuses are the engagement's own append-only",
        "transition log; KPI values are entries a person captured with a source and a date, printed verbatim; gaps come from the same",
        "register the /gaps page renders. Where no measurement was recorded the pack says so — it never substitutes a derived or",
        "illustrative figure.",
        "THIS PACK CLAIMS ITS PERIOD AND NOTHING OUTSIDE IT. Transitions and captures are filtered to the reporting period",
        "printed below, inclusive of both boundary dates. No comparison to any earlier period appears, and no judgement of progress is",
        "made in either direction — a single period cannot ground one. Reading movement across periods is a separate instrument,",
        "deliberately not this one.",
        "STATUS AND DISPOSITION ARE DIFFERENT FACTS. A register entry's builtFrom disposition says how an artefact is built; the status log says",
        "where it stands in THIS engagement. The pack prints the second and never restates the first as delivery progress.",
